	(text "This circuit implements enough I/O for one bank of digital front ends via an MCP23S17 16-bit I/O expander.\nThis allows them to be controlled using SPI commands at a clock of up to 10MHz.\nNote that the expander is powered off of 5V in order to produce 5V I/O for the front ends."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
